id: F21
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feSqrtRatioVartime: retry-branch condition inverted, 'if feIsNonZero(vxx)' -> 'if not feIsNonZero(vxx)' (the first check, deciding whether the initial candidate root already satisfies v*x^2 == u) -- retries with sqrt(-1) exactly when the candidate was ALREADY correct, and skips the retry exactly when it was needed.
====OLD====
  if feIsNonZeroVartime(vxx):
    # v*x^2 != u; retry with x*sqrt(-1), which squares to -x^2.
====NEW====
  if not feIsNonZeroVartime(vxx):
    # v*x^2 != u; retry with x*sqrt(-1), which squares to -x^2.
====END====
